# midi_sim.jgs -- mididevice, midisend, midireceive and the midicontrols family on
# jgraph.internal.midisim's devices (device classes plan, stage D10b, ADR 0194). JGraph-only: this
# machine has no MIDI input for R2025b to receive from, and its outputs keep nothing to read back, so
# expected/midi_sim.txt is written from the rule. The cases are MATLAB code in helpers/midi_sim_case.m.

